Nova E-commerce Template — showcase repository
==============================================

Copyright (c) 2026 Ömer Aygün. All rights reserved.

This repository is a showcase of the commercial "Nova" e-commerce template. It contains
screenshots, documentation and links to the live demos so the product can be evaluated.
The template's source code is not part of this repository.

You may view and share links to this page. You may not copy, republish or redistribute the
screenshots, documentation or any part of Nova without written permission.

The template itself is sold through online marketplaces (Envato Market and TemplateMonster /
MonsterONE) under the licence terms of the marketplace where it is bought; see
docs/CREDITS.md and docs/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the open-source components it uses.
